::  name       caravan max children
::  shape      children - int (@u32)
::  invariant  the capability table holds at most four child slots (max_children)
::  example    4
::  readers    Caravan · Glow Tend · Tally · Amphora · Ashvini nest-only
::  nib        equinox-e194-caravan-tend-v0
::
::  Equinox e194 · nest-only Ashvini under Equinox B — first Caravan Glow Tend limb.
::  Names max_children from caravan/capabilities.rye. Pedestal only; Rye still
::  owns supervision. Does not restart processes from Glow.
+$  caravan-max-children-shape
  $:  children=@u32
  ==
